 can hear singing. Names again, like the forest. But she keeps losing her place."},{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"Don\u2019t drink the water. Don\u2019t even look at it too long."},{"c":"set","sw":"hollow_intro","v":true}]}]},{"id":7,"x":8,"y":16,"realm":"both","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"stones_hint"},"g":null,"trigger":"touch","list":[{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"On the Near Shore the river is one smooth violet sheet. On the Far Shore, flat stones stand in a line across it."},{"c":"set","sw":"stones_hint","v":true}],"through":true}]},{"id":8,"x":14,"y":7,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"curtain_hint"},"g":null,"trigger":"touch","list":[{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"On the Far Shore the willow curtain is only mist. Past it, drowned roots knot together on the Far Shore\u2026 and are gone on the Near."},{"c":"set","sw":"curtain_hint","v":true}],"through":true}]},{"id":9,"x":28,"y":4,"realm":"both","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"willow_done"},"g":{"sheet":"willow","dir":"down","nofar":true},"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"msg","face":"willow","name":"Willow Mother","text":"Who are you? Are you one of mine? I had so many. I have forgotten their names. I sing them, and they slip into the water."},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"We\u2019re not yours. But we can help you remember."},{"c":"msg","face":"willow","name":"Willow Mother","text":"Remember? Then you will take them away from me. Like the village did. Like the river does."},{"c":"if","cond":{"nsw":"willow_tip"},"then":[{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"She is grieving, not hunting. Words may reach her where blades won\u2019t."},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":"Tip","text":"The Willow Mother can\u2019t be beaten by force: her roots drink the river and her wounds close. Choose Parley and Remember her children three times. Once she is Calm, Send her home."},{"c":"set","sw":"willow_tip","v":true}]},{"c":"choice","opts":["Face the Willow Mother","Wait. Prepare first"],"br":[[{"c":"checkpoint","boss":true},{"c":"battle","troop":"boss_willow_mother","boss":true,"noEscape":true,"win":[{"c":"me","name":"fanfare"},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"The weeping stops. The branches lift, and for the first time the hollow is full of light."},{"c":"msg","face":"willow","name":"Willow Mother","text":"Hana. Ren. Little Sou. I remember now. I remember all of them."},{"c":"msg","face":"willow","name":"Willow Mother","text":"You came for the wick. It grew in the glade where my children played. Take this, and plant it on my bank. It will carry you across."},{"c":"item","id":"willow_sprig","n":1,"quiet":false},{"c":"set","sw":"willow_done","v":true},{"c":"quest","id":"ch3","stage":6,"done":false,"quiet":false},{"c":"msg","face":"willow","name":"Willow Mother","text":"There was a girl, once. A camellia in her hair. She crossed my river and would not let me take her name. Tsubaki. Tsubaki. I am still holding it for her."},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"Tsubaki\u2026"},{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"\u2026"}],"lose":[{"c":"abort"}],"wipe":{"realm":"near","lines":[{"face":null,"name":null,"text":"The hollow goes dark\u2026 and then a small, warm light flickers from the glade beyond the river."},{"face":"lantern","name":"Whisper Wick","text":"She does not need to be beaten, little lantern. She needs to be remembered. Parley: Remember her children three times until she is Calm, then Send her home."},{"face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"You heard it. Words, not blades. Let\u2019s try again."}]}}],[]],"cancel":-1}]},{"cond":{"sw":"willow_done"},"g":{"sheet":"willow","dir":"down","nofar":true,"tint":15269864},"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"msg","face":"willow","name":"Willow Mother","text":"Plant the sprig on the bank, little lantern. Its roots know the way."}]}]},{"id":10,"x":29,"y":11,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"sprig_planted"},"g":null,"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"Soft dark soil at the river\u2019s edge, warm to the touch."},{"c":"if","cond":{"item":"willow_sprig"},"then":[{"c":"choice","opts":["Plant the Willow Sprig","Not yet"],"br":[[{"c":"item","id":"willow_sprig","n":-1,"quiet":true},{"c":"se","name":"magic"},{"c":"shake","power":1,"ms":700},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"The sprig sinks into the soil. Roots pour across the river, weaving themselves into a bridge."},{"c":"set","sw":"sprig_planted","v":true}],[]],"cancel":-1}],"else":[{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"Something should grow here. Not yet."}]}]},{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":null,"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"A young willow, already taller than Mio. Its roots hold the bridge."}]}]},{"id":11,"x":28,"y":12,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"block_sand","flat":true},"trigger":"action","list":[],"through":true}]},{"id":12,"x":28,"y":13,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"block_sand","flat":true},"trigger":"action","list":[],"through":true}]},{"id":13,"x":28,"y":14,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"block_sand","flat":true},"trigger":"action","list":[],"through":true}]},{"id":14,"x":28,"y":15,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"block_sand","flat":true},"trigger":"action","list":[],"through":true}]},{"id":15,"x":29,"y":12,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"block_sand","flat":true},"trigger":"action","list":[],"through":true}]},{"id":16,"x":29,"y":13,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"block_sand","flat":true},"trigger":"action","list":[],"through":true}]},{"id":17,"x":29,"y":14,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"block_sand","flat":true},"trigger":"action","list":[],"through":true}]},{"id":18,"x":29,"y":15,"realm":"far","pages":[{"cond":{"sw":"sprig_planted"},"g":{"obj":"b